The details of financial support offered under PMFME Scheme for technical/technological support, capacity building/training, market linkages and awareness are as under:

(i). Support to Individual / Group Category Micro Enterprises: Credit-linked capital subsidy @35% of the eligible project cost, maximum ceiling Rs.10 lakh per unit;

